$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Xaos" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Raining" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Late Eve" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Very little has changed in the epic battle between the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> .In fact, they are still battling each other at close range with their massive flying bases, but now they've been jacked up with a small  way station added and a few sniper nests to make defense more of a challenge.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base, touch it to their own flag to capture it.  The first team with 5 captures shall be the victor!";